From e2fdd7401bed467a3a119a7a60d807ac3ee34dec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:38:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] QNS: Wi-Fi calling activation without androidx

The activation screen was the only androidx user in QNS (FragmentActivity,
an activity-result launcher, a fragment dialog and Custom Tabs). Move it
to platform classes: Activity with startActivityForResult, a plain
AlertDialog, and the carrier's portal opened in the default browser
instead of a Custom Tab. The flow and its results are unchanged. Drop the
appcompat and browser dependencies. Everything else in QNS already builds
against Android 15 QPR2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SByt7CZfKR6U4r1VS86tHS
